      "side": 1,
      "message": "Still open on PS6 (confirmed live: /visual/allocation-graphic.html and /visual/graphic return 500 while /visual/graph is fine). Smallest safe fix is to wrap the open() in this loop with try/except OSError: continue, mirroring the /graph route: get_file_paths walks into graph/ and yields the bare basename, so open(VISUAL_DIR/\u003cbasename\u003e) misses the graph/ segment and raises FileNotFoundError. continue is safe because os.walk is top-down, so a real top-level heatmap match is always served first; the alternatives (stop recursing, or return relative paths) break the dynamic_content /\u003cdirectory\u003e/\u003cpage\u003e caller.",
